OL,3,ATennessee prison chief to resign after
OL,4,AChrista Pike's failed execution,
OL,5,Agovernor says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe head of prisons in the US state of
OL,8,FTennessee is resigning after the failed
OL,9,Fexecution of death row inmate Christa
OL,10,FPike on Wednesday.
OL,12,FGovernor Bill Lee announced the change
OL,13,Fon Saturday, sharing the news in a
OL,14,Fjoint statement with Tennessee
OL,15,FDepartment of Correction Commissioner
OL,16,FFrank Strada.
OL,18,FStrada said that his stepping down is
OL,19,F"in the best interests" of the state,
OL,20,Fand called the ongoing investigation
OL,21,Finto the incident "entirely appropriate
OL,22,Fand necessary".
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
