OL,3,ATennessee prison chief to resign after
OL,4,AChrista Pike's failed execution,
OL,5,Agovernor says
OL,6,
OL,7,FPike, who was sentenced to death in
OL,8,F1996 for the murder of Colleen Slemmer,
OL,9,Fsurvived two injections and is now in
OL,10,Fcritical condition at a Tennessee
OL,11,Fhospital as her lawyers seek to commute
OL,12,Fher sentence.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
